# Chat experience

When a chat screenshot shows a raw log, a script, or a duplicated failure, follow `docs/zh-CN/chat-experience.md`.

- One fact lives on the surface that already owns it (the tool row, the confirm card, or a single failure sentence).
- The original text stays, collapsed by default.
- Strip terminal color codes before display, including leftover `[31m` / `[0m`.
- Classify a runtime log by shape (color codes, or a timestamp plus a severity). Do not add a branch for one error string, app, or folder.
